#: src/YGUI.cc:134
msgid ""
"Command line options for the YaST2 UI (GTK plugin):\n"
"\n"
"--noborder    no window manager border for main dialogs\n"
"--fullscreen  use full screen for main dialogs\n"
"--nothreads   run without additional UI threads\n"
"--help        prints this help text\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"ຕົວເລືອກຄຳສັ່ງ (Command line) ສຳລັບ YaST2 UI (GTK plugin):\n"
"\n"
"--noborder    ບໍ່ມີຂອບຕົວຈັດການໜ້າຕ່າງສຳລັບໄດອາລັອກຫຼັກ\n"
"--fullscreen  ໃຊ້ໂໝດເຕັມຈໍສຳລັບໄດອາລັອກຫຼັກ\n"
"--nothreads   ເຮັດວຽກໂດຍບໍ່ມີເທຣດ (threads) UI ເພີ່ມເຕີມ\n"
"--help        ສະແດງຂໍ້ຄວາມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອນີ້\n"
"\n"

